 # SkillNemesis
-SkillNemesis OSRS plugin+
+SkillNemesis is a RuneLite plugin that highlights the player's current "nemesis" skill: the tracked skill furthest below a configurable target level. On login, it can post a short game message naming the skill, current real level, target level, and level gap.
+
+This repo is structured as a standalone external RuneLite plugin using the same Gradle/wrapper conventions as the `breach-check-osrs` boilerplate.
+
+## Features
+
+- Scans the logged-in player's real levels for every RuneLite skill except `OVERALL`.
+- Finds the skill with the largest gap below the configured target level.
+- Posts an optional login summary in the chat box.
+- Keeps ranking logic in a RuneLite-free analyzer class so it can be tested without launching the client.
+
+## Configuration
+
+RuneLite exposes these settings under the `SkillNemesis` config group:
+
+| Setting | Default | Description |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| Show Login Summary | `true` | Enables or disables the login chat message. |
+| Target Level | `70` | The level each skill is compared against when selecting the nemesis skill. Valid range: 1-99. |
+
+## Development
+
+Use Java 11 when building this plugin:
+
+```bash
+export JAVA_HOME=/opt/data/jdks/current-java11
+export PATH="$JAVA_HOME/bin:$PATH"
+```
+
+Run tests:
+
+```bash
+./gradlew test --no-daemon -q
+```
+
+Build the plugin:
+
+```bash
+./gradlew assemble --no-daemon -q
+```
+
+Launch a developer RuneLite client with the plugin loaded:
+
+```bash
+./gradlew run --no-daemon
+```
+
+## Project layout
+
+```text
+src/main/java/com/itmeansbigmountain/skillnemesis/
+  SkillNemesisPlugin.java      RuneLite plugin entry point
+  SkillNemesisConfig.java      RuneLite config interface
+  SkillNemesisAnalyzer.java    Pure Java nemesis-selection logic
+  SkillNemesisAnalysis.java    Pure Java analysis result/message formatter
+src/test/java/com/itmeansbigmountain/skillnemesis/
+  SkillNemesisPluginTest.java      JUnit smoke tests for analyzer behavior
+  SkillNemesisPluginLauncher.java  Developer launcher used by ./gradlew run
+```
+
+## API usage notes
+
+SkillNemesis currently uses only the local RuneLite client API (`Client#getRealSkillLevel`) and does not call external services such as Wise Old Man, TempleOSRS, or the official hiscores. That keeps the plugin lightweight and avoids network rate-limit concerns. If rival-account comparisons are added later, put network calls behind caching and background execution rather than blocking the game thread.
+
+## Manual testing checklist
+
+Before plugin-hub prep, verify in a live RuneLite developer client:
+
+1. Start the client with `./gradlew run --no-daemon`.
+2. Enable SkillNemesis in the plugin list.
+3. Log into an account and confirm the chat message appears when `Show Login Summary` is enabled.
+4. Change `Target Level` and re-log/reload the plugin to confirm the selected nemesis skill and gap update.
+5. Disable `Show Login Summary` and confirm no login message is posted.
+
+## Plugin-hub prep notes
+
